item.description:
Abstract Sooner or later, every data project gets the same request: &ldquo;Can we have a dashboard for this?&rdquo;
Commercial tools like Power BI and Tableau do this job well, but their per-user licenses add up quickly. Simple open-source tools are easy to start with, yet many of them keep fine-grained data permissions for their paid plans.
So I spent some time looking at Apache Superset, an open-source BI platform that started at Airbnb and is now a top-level Apache project.
